:: The Begining [MainTimeLine] {"position":"400,300","size":"100,100"}
<img src="C:\Users\Surface LaptopGo\OneDrive\PSU 26-27\ENG202\images\towering-trees-enchanted-forest_961875-464234.avif" width="850px">


You open your eyes to trees swaying above you and the soft sound of birds chirping. "Where am I" you mutter. You don't remember falling asleep out here. The last thing you remember was walking onto a strange path folowing a trail of medical [[herbs.]] 


:: Yes [MainTimeLine] {"position":"1025,300","size":"100,100"}
Thank you! it has always been my dream to go fishing in the starlight lake. I've heard they are the yummiest fish out there :3. However I've never been able to make it there, the final bridge is guarded by a fearsome [[troll]]


:: across [MainTimeLine] {"position":"1100,800","size":"100,100"}
After a considerable hike up the mountain you find the final bridge. It is a draw bridge guarded by the biggest troll you have ever seen. 

'''SPROUT'' "Hello good Franky" 
(t8n:"slide-right")+(t8n-delay:2s)[''Troll 3/Franly'' "Hello my friend, here to [[try again]]?"]
(t8n:"slide-right")+(t8n-delay:2s)['''SPROUT'' "We will beat your riddle this time!" ]


:: borrow [MainTimeLine] {"position":"775,300","size":"100,100"}
This is the small patch of land I call home, while your here would you [[help]] me?


:: bridge [MainTimeLine] {"position":"975,800","size":"100,100"}
''Sprout'' 'This is so fun, I'm so glad that you came with me even if we don't get [[across]] the bridge, i made a friend at least. 



:: bridge. [MainTimeLine] {"position":"1225,550","size":"100,100"}
The troll hears you approach and stands up.  ''Troll 1'' " Answer my [[Riddle]] you must to cross, Answer wrong and you have lost"


:: cross my bridge. [MainTimeLine] {"position":"1225,675","size":"100,100"}
You move across the bridge waving to the troll on your way. You walk a little ways farther [[into the forest.]]


:: cross. [MainTimeLine] {"position":"1275,425","size":"100,100"}
The Sun is starting to set we should leave before it gets [[dark.]]


:: dark. [MainTimeLine] {"position":"1150,425","size":"100,100"}
You start walking through the forest. Your first stop is at a small [[stump]].


:: deeper [MainTimeLine] {"position":"975,550","size":"100,100"}
As you walk you notice a small rope bridge in the distence. You walk into the clearing around the mouth of the bridge and you notice a [[small grey lump]] in the middle of the bridge. 


:: fishing [MainTimeLine] {"position":"725,550","size":"100,100"}
''Tiki'': of course my friend. Seems like your brining someone aling with you this time. Well here you go goodluck! (text-style:"italic","subscript")[Pick up [[Fishing Rod]]]


