You stumbled into a clearing to see a small gazebo over run with vines and decay. Now you were waking up in a feild //Wonderful// you think. After brushing yourself off you start walking [[Into the thicket]]. When all of a sudden you hear a small voice.


:: hole [MainTimeLine] {"position":"900,425","size":"100,100"}
You see a small pair of eyes looking back at you. A small raccoon pokes his head through the hole "how can I help you folks [[today]]?"


